

# type(scope): emoji subject            (72 characters at most, imperative, no full stop)
#
# Types and emojis (the emoji goes right after the colon):
#   feat ✨  fix 🐛  perf ⚡️  refactor ♻️  test ✅  docs 📝
#   style 🎨  build 📦  ci 👷  chore 🔧  revert ⏪   breaking change: type! and 💥
# Scopes: readme assets deps ci harness
#
# Body: why the change, not what (the diff shows what).
# Footers: Refs: #12    BREAKING CHANGE: what breaks and how to migrate
#
# Example: docs(readme): 📝 add the current focus line
